    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this dashboard",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Follow the data path:** source broker → TACTIC ingress → internal EMQX → MQTT proxy → TimescaleDB and accepted topics. Source retry logs, broker warnings and writer errors identify the failing hop.\n\nCollection counters and storage capacity are not exported to Loki. Successful write detail is DEBUG-only; these panels report **failure signals and slow-write samples**, not ingest throughput, data completeness or disk space."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
